---
description: Testing
globs:
  - "**/*.test.ts"
  - "**/*.test.tsx"
  - e2e/**
  - apps/storybook/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Unit: Vitest. E2E: Playwright on studio shell.

Colocate unit tests in a `tests/` folder next to the module — same hierarchy as `hooks/` / `views/` / `models/`. Never `foo.test.ts` beside `foo.ts`.

```text
domain/brands/brand-config-schema.ts
domain/brands/tests/brand-config-schema.test.ts

features/plan-edit/tests/no-session-storage-handoff.test.ts
```

Test real behaviour: nav config, seed invariants, DAL column selects.

Storybook build smoke optional in CI.

One smoke test per module is fine. Do not delete for being minimal.
